  .git:.hg:.svn:.bzr:.fslckout:.cvs:\
  .aux:.bbl:.blg:.toc:.out:.lof:.lot:.fls:.fdb_latexmk:.synctex.gz:.synctex:\
  .xdv:.nav:.snm:.vrb:.run.xml:.dvi:.pdfsync:.brf:.auxlock:.ilg:.ind:.idx:.glg:.glo:.gls:.glsdefs:.gaux:.loa:.lol:.ltjruby:.luac:.lx64fsl:.maf:.mf:.mlf:.mlt:.mod:.mp:.mw:.nav:.nlg:.nlo:.nls:.pax:.pdfpc:.pre:.pyg:.pytxcode:.save:.sympy:.texpadtmp:.tdo:.ttt:.upa:.upb:.ver:.wrt:.xdy:.xyc:\
  .tmp:.swp:.swo:.bak:.backup:.old:.orig:.rej:\
  .o:.obj:.so:.dll:.pyc:.pyo:.rbc:.rbo:.class:\
  # Emacs lock files
.#*:\
  # Vim and NeoVim swap files
.viminfo:.exrc:.vimrc~:\
  # JetBrains IDE files
.idea:*.iml:*.ipr:*.iws:\
  # Visual Studio files
*.user:*.suo:*.userosscache:\
